{"name":"Melanophobia","hex":"#01081c","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"melanophobia","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Fear, hate, or dislike of black people.","Fear of, or aversion to, the colour black."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Fear of ink."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/melanophobia"}],"entries":[{"title":"Anti-Black racism","blocks":[{"text":"Anti-Black racism, also called anti-Blackness, colourphobia or negrophobia, is characterised by prejudice, collective hatred, and discrimination or extreme aversion towards people who are racialized as Black, as well as a loathing of Black culture worldwide. Such sentiment includes, but is not limited to, the attribution of negative characteristics to Black people; the fear, strong dislike or dehumanisation of Black men; and the objectification and dehumanisation of Black women."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Ku-Klux_Klan_at_Baltimore_%281923%29.jpg/330px-Ku-Klux_Klan_at_Baltimore_%281923%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anti-Black_racism","wikidata":"Q21071541"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/Presidente_Rafael_L._Trujillo_en_1945_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Presidente_Rafael_L._Trujillo_en_1945_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/Presidente_Rafael_L._Trujillo_en_1945_%28cropped%29.jpg/1280px-Presidente_Rafael_L._Trujillo_en_1945_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/Presidente_Rafael_L._Trujillo_en_1945_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Presidente_Rafael_L._Trujillo_en_1945_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Dominican di